        <mxCell id="seq0-2" value="Example question: “Get me all admins, and also users named John.” Pages 1–3 show the same turn at component level.&lt;br&gt;Only Claude is AI-driven: it picks the tools, their filters and the wording. Everything else is ordinary, deterministic code.&lt;br&gt;Code: frontend/src/features/assistant · backend/src/features/ai (ai.service.ts numbers the steps [app] / [AI])&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Notation:&lt;/b&gt; solid line, filled head = call · open head = asynchronous or streamed message (SSE) · dashed = return · narrow bars = activation&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Colours:&lt;/b&gt; blue = browser (React) · green = API (NestJS) · orange = Claude (Anthropic API) · grey = PostgreSQL" style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;backgroundOutline=1;size=12;fillColor=#fdfdfd;strokeColor=#999999;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=10;spacingRight=10;spacingTop=4;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="58" width="910" height="84" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
