        <mxCell id="seq2-1" value="2 · The model–tool loop, the stream and the save (steps 4–9)" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=18;fontStyle=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="16" width="660" height="32" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="seq2-2" value="Continues page 1. One streamText call runs the rounds by itself: Claude answers or calls tools, the AI SDK runs each tool's execute,&lt;br&gt;and Claude reads the results, until it answers without a tool call. Every part streams to the browser as it is produced.&lt;br&gt;Code: backend/src/features/ai/ai.service.ts (streamText, toUIMessageStream, onEnd) · ai.tools.ts (listUsers) · conversations.service.ts&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Notation:&lt;/b&gt; solid line, filled head = call · open head = asynchronous or streamed message (SSE) · dashed = return · narrow bars = activation&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Colours:&lt;/b&gt; blue = browser (React) · green = API (NestJS) · orange = Claude (Anthropic API) · grey = PostgreSQL" style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;backgroundOutline=1;size=12;fillColor=#fdfdfd;strokeColor=#999999;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=10;spacingRight=10;spacingTop=4;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="58" width="910" height="84" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
