        <mxCell id="seq4-1" value="4 · Pick lists too long for the prompt: the lookup helper tool" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=18;fontStyle=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="16" width="682" height="32" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="seq4-2" value="Example: “Chart the Riverside reservoir level for the last 7 days” in a plant with more tags than AI_PICK_LIST_INLINE_MAX (100).&lt;br&gt;The tag list is still loaded on the server, only left out of the prompt, so the id checks work as before. The chat never draws a lookup.&lt;br&gt;Code: backend/src/features/ai/ai.tools.ts (filterOptions, lookup, plotTags), pick-list-lines.ts, system-prompt.ts&lt;br&gt;frontend/src/features/assistant/components/chat-message.tsx, lib/visible-parts.ts&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Notation:&lt;/b&gt; solid line, filled head = call · open head = asynchronous or streamed message (SSE) · dashed = return · narrow bars = activation&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Colours:&lt;/b&gt; blue = browser (React) · green = API (NestJS) · orange = Claude (Anthropic API) · grey = PostgreSQL" style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;backgroundOutline=1;size=12;fillColor=#fdfdfd;strokeColor=#999999;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=10;spacingRight=10;spacingTop=4;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="58" width="910" height="98" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
