        <mxCell id="seq4-18" value="filterOptions: tags.length &amp;gt; AI_PICK_LIST_INLINE_MAX&lt;br&gt;→ deferred: [“tags”]. The prompt has a one-line note&lt;br&gt;instead of &amp;lt;tags&amp;gt;, and only now is lookup offered." style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;backgroundOutline=1;size=10;fillColor=#fdfdfd;strokeColor=#999999;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=6;spacingRight=6;spacingTop=2;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="297" y="258" width="438" height="54" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="seq4-19" value="onEnd saves the lookup with the answer (a helper tool part). Later turns read its ids&lt;br&gt;back from the cached history instead of looking them up again; old lookups are never pruned." style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;backgroundOutline=1;size=10;fillColor=#fdfdfd;strokeColor=#999999;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=6;spacingRight=6;spacingTop=2;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="297" y="1096" width="950" height="40" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
