  <diagram id="ai-assistant-seq-5" name="5 Forms in the chat">
    <mxGraphModel dx="1600" dy="1000" grid="1" gridSize="10" guides="1" tooltips="1" connect="1" arrows="1" fold="1" page="1" pageScale="1" pageWidth="1438" pageHeight="1528" background="#ffffff" math="0" shadow="0">
      <root>
        <mxCell id="0" />
        <mxCell id="1" parent="0" />
        <mxCell id="seq5-1" value="5 · Forms in the chat: open, save, record the outcome" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=18;fontStyle=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="16" width="600" height="32" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="seq5-2" value="Example (an admin, components on): “raise the threshold of wet wel hihg levl to 5”. A form tool never writes: it opens the page's own form&lt;br&gt;inside the answer, and the user saves it through the REST endpoint the page's modal uses. The browser then reports what happened.&lt;br&gt;Code: backend/src/features/ai/ai.tools.ts (editAlarmRule), ai-forms.service.ts, conversations.service.ts (update)&lt;br&gt;frontend/src/features/assistant/components/form-part-view.tsx, form-bodies/edit-alarm-rule-body.tsx, hooks/use-record-form-outcome.ts&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Notation:&lt;/b&gt; solid line, filled head = call · open head = asynchronous or streamed message (SSE) · dashed = return · narrow bars = activation&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Colours:&lt;/b&gt; blue = browser (React) · green = API (NestJS) · orange = Claude (Anthropic API) · grey = PostgreSQL" style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;backgroundOutline=1;size=12;fillColor=#fdfdfd;strokeColor=#999999;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=10;spacingRight=10;spacingTop=4;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="58" width="910" height="98" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="seq5-3" value="User" style="shape=umlLifeline;participant=umlActor;perimeter=lifelinePerimeter;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;container=1;dropTarget=0;collapsible=0;recursiveResize=0;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=34;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;outlineConnect=0;portConstraint=eastwest;newEdgeStyle={&quot;curved&quot;:0,&quot;rounded&quot;:0};size=32;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#333333;fontSize=12;fontStyle=1;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="44" y="184" width="40" height="1304" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
