        <mxCell id="seq6-1" value="6 · Dashboard drafts: preview, open, save, status" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=18;fontStyle=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="16" width="600" height="32" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="seq6-2" value="Example: “a dashboard for Riverside with the open critical alarms, a 7-day chart of the reservoir level and who's on duty”.&lt;br&gt;createDashboard never writes: the tool call saved in the conversation is the draft. Whether a dashboard was created from it is read from&lt;br&gt;the dashboards every time (source_conversation_id + source_tool_call_id, unique), never written into the conversation.&lt;br&gt;Code: backend/src/features/ai/dashboard-draft-summary.ts, dashboard-drafts.service.ts · dashboards/dashboards.service.ts (create, createdFrom)&lt;br&gt;frontend/src/features/assistant/components/tool-bodies/dashboard-draft-body.tsx · frontend/src/routes/_authenticated/dashboard.tsx&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Notation:&lt;/b&gt; solid line, filled head = call · open head = asynchronous or streamed message (SSE) · dashed = return · narrow bars = activation&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Colours:&lt;/b&gt; blue = browser (React) · green = API (NestJS) · orange = Claude (Anthropic API) · grey = PostgreSQL" style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;backgroundOutline=1;size=12;fillColor=#fdfdfd;strokeColor=#999999;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=10;spacingRight=10;spacingTop=4;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="58" width="935" height="112" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="seq6-3" value="User" style="shape=umlLifeline;participant=umlActor;perimeter=lifelinePerimeter;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;container=1;dropTarget=0;collapsible=0;recursiveResize=0;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=34;labelBackgroundColor=#ffffff;outlineConnect=0;portConstraint=eastwest;newEdgeStyle={&quot;curved&quot;:0,&quot;rounded&quot;:0};size=32;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#333333;fontSize=12;fontStyle=1;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="44" y="198" width="40" height="1376" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="seq6-4" value="&lt;b&gt;Chat tab&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:10px&quot;&gt;DashboardDraftBody&lt;/span&gt;" style="shape=umlLifeline;perimeter=lifelinePerimeter;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;container=1;dropTarget=0;collapsible=0;recursiveResize=0;outlineConnect=0;portConstraint=eastwest;newEdgeStyle={&quot;curved&quot;:0,&quot;rounded&quot;:0};size=48;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;fontSize=12;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="249" y="198" width="158" height="1376" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
