        <mxCell id="seq8-1" value="8 · Opening, renaming and deleting a chat; stopping an answer" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=18;fontStyle=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="16" width="671" height="32" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="seq8-2" value="chat-store keeps every chat shown in the tab as an AI SDK Chat (up to 10 idle ones), so switching chats never stops an answer.&lt;br&gt;Stop, a closed tab and a stream silent for SILENCE_TIMEOUT_MS all end the same way: what came so far is saved.&lt;br&gt;Code: frontend/src/features/assistant/store/chat-store.ts (openChat, deleteChat), components/chat-nav.tsx, hooks/use-chat-actions.tsx&lt;br&gt;backend/src/features/ai/ai.controller.ts, ai.service.ts (onEnd, withStoppedToolCalls, withoutEmptyAnswer), conversations.service.ts&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Notation:&lt;/b&gt; solid line, filled head = call · open head = asynchronous or streamed message (SSE) · dashed = return · narrow bars = activation&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Colours:&lt;/b&gt; blue = browser (React) · green = API (NestJS) · orange = Claude (Anthropic API) · grey = PostgreSQL" style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;backgroundOutline=1;size=12;fillColor=#fdfdfd;strokeColor=#999999;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=10;spacingRight=10;spacingTop=4;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="58" width="910" height="98" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
